  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the ecosystem added 79 new plugins and the official repo gained 443 stars, while dsh-our-free-model topped growth with +1,068 stars on its no-login model access. Yet 15,544 of 19,394 non-fork plugins have been stale for over 7 days, leaving the health score at 40 — attention is concentrated at the top, so the long tail is worth watching.",
    "zh": "过去 8 小时新增 <b>79</b> 个插件，官方仓库星标涨了 <b>443</b>；增长榜第一的 dsh-our-free-model 单日涨 <b>1068</b> 星，免登录用模型的卖点确实吸量。不过 19394 个非 fork 插件里有 <b>15544</b> 个超过 7 天没更新，健康分只有 <b>40</b>，热度集中在头部、长尾偏冷，建议持续观察。"
